msgid "Clear the Graphs on this page from the Graphs Queue so that you have a blank QuickTree ready for new selections"
msgstr "Kpochapụ Eserese dị na ibe a site n'Ahịrị Eserese ka ị nwee QuickTree tọgbọrọ chakoo dị njikere maka nhọrọ ọhụrụ"

#: quicktree.php
